      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you feel this desperate weight, and I want to be very clear that \"stopping\" to end your life is not the solution to a void that is real and painful for you.\n\nPlease remember that you do not have to stick to a \"fake\" self, and you can find your \"why\" even when the old foundation is gone.\n\nYou deserve help to navigate this dark place with a safe person who can hold you while you find a way to start again.\n\nIf you are in immediate crisis, please call 988 and let a human be there to help you feel safe.",
